# Netblade API Testing Collection

This file contains sample API requests for testing all endpoints.
Use with REST Client extension in VS Code or import into Postman.

@baseURL = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

###############################################
# AUTHENTICATION
###############################################

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/health

### Register New User
POST {{baseURL}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test@123",
  "username": "testuser"
}

### Login
POST {{baseURL}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### Get Current User (Protected)
GET {{baseURL}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Password (Protected)
PUT {{baseURL}}/auth/update-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Password@123",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword@123"
}

### Forgot Password
POST {{baseURL}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com"
}

### Logout (Protected)
GET {{baseURL}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###############################################
# USERS
###############################################

### Get My Profile (Protected)
GET {{baseURL}}/users/profile/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Profile (Protected)
PUT {{baseURL}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe Updated",
  "bio": "Updated bio about trading",
  "location": "New York, USA",
  "website": "https://johndoe-trading.com",
  "experienceLevel": "advanced",
  "interests": ["Technical Analysis", "Day Trading", "Crypto"],
  "skills": ["Chart Patterns", "Risk Management"]
}

### Get User by Username
GET {{baseURL}}/users/johndoe

### Follow User (Protected)
POST {{baseURL}}/users/USER_ID_HERE/follow
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unfollow User (Protected)
DELETE {{baseURL}}/users/USER_ID_HERE/unfollow
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get User Followers
GET {{baseURL}}/users/USER_ID_HERE/followers

### Get User Following
GET {{baseURL}}/users/USER_ID_HERE/following

### Search Users
GET {{baseURL}}/users/search?q=john&limit=10

### Update Notification Preferences (Protected)
PUT {{baseURL}}/users/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailUpdates": true,
  "marketAlerts": true,
  "communityMentions": false,
  "weeklyDigest": true
}

###############################################
# COURSES
###############################################

### Get All Courses
GET {{baseURL}}/courses?limit=20&page=1

### Get Courses by Category
GET {{baseURL}}/courses?category=Technical%20Analysis

### Get Courses by Level
GET {{baseURL}}/courses?level=Beginner

### Search Courses
GET {{baseURL}}/courses?search=risk%20management

### Get Featured Courses
GET {{baseURL}}/courses?featured=true

### Get Single Course
GET {{baseURL}}/courses/COURSE_ID_HERE

### Enroll in Course (Protected)
POST {{baseURL}}/courses/COURSE_ID_HERE/enroll
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get My Enrolled Courses (Protected)
GET {{baseURL}}/courses/my/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Course Progress (Protected)
PUT {{baseURL}}/courses/COURSE_ID_HERE/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "moduleNumber": 1,
  "lessonNumber": 2,
  "completed": true,
  "quizScore": 85
}

### Get Course Lessons (Protected - Must be enrolled)
GET {{baseURL}}/courses/COURSE_ID_HERE/lessons
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###############################################
# COMMUNITY
###############################################

### Get All Posts
GET {{baseURL}}/community/posts?limit=20&page=1

### Get Posts by Category
GET {{baseURL}}/community/posts?category=Market%20Analysis

### Get Single Post
GET {{baseURL}}/community/posts/POST_ID_HERE

### Create Post (Protected)
POST {{baseURL}}/community/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Just learned about support and resistance levels! Can't wait to apply this in my trading 📈",
  "category": "General",
  "tags": ["learning", "technical-analysis"]
}

### Update Post (Protected)
PUT {{baseURL}}/community/posts/POST_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Updated: Just learned about support and resistance levels!",
  "category": "General",
  "tags": ["learning", "technical-analysis", "updated"]
}

### Delete Post (Protected)
DELETE {{baseURL}}/community/posts/POST_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Like/Unlike Post (Protected)
POST {{baseURL}}/community/posts/POST_ID_HERE/like
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Comment on Post (Protected)
POST {{baseURL}}/community/posts/POST_ID_HERE/comment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Great post! I learned this last week and it really helped my trading."
}

### Get User's Posts
GET {{baseURL}}/community/posts/user/johndoe

###############################################
# ARTICLES
###############################################

### Get All Articles
GET {{baseURL}}/articles?limit=20&page=1

### Get Articles by Category
GET {{baseURL}}/articles?category=Market%20Analysis

### Get Featured Articles
GET {{baseURL}}/articles/featured

### Search Articles
GET {{baseURL}}/articles?search=risk%20management

### Get Single Article
GET {{baseURL}}/articles/ARTICLE_ID_HERE

### Get Article by Slug
GET {{baseURL}}/articles/slug/understanding-market-cycles-from-bull-to-bear

### Like Article (Protected)
POST {{baseURL}}/articles/ARTICLE_ID_HERE/like
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bookmark Article (Protected)
POST {{baseURL}}/articles/ARTICLE_ID_HERE/bookmark
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Comment on Article (Protected)
POST {{baseURL}}/articles/ARTICLE_ID_HERE/comment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Excellent article! Very helpful for understanding market dynamics."
}

### Get Articles by Category
GET {{baseURL}}/articles/category/Risk%20Management

###############################################
# MARKET DATA
###############################################

### Get Live Market Prices
GET {{baseURL}}/market/live-prices

### Get Specific Symbols
GET {{baseURL}}/market/live-prices?symbols=NIFTY50,SENSEX,BTCUSD

### Get Market Scanner
GET {{baseURL}}/market/scanner

### Get Economic Calendar
GET {{baseURL}}/market/calendar

### Get Market Insights
GET {{baseURL}}/market/insights

### Create Market Alert (Protected)
POST {{baseURL}}/market/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "NIFTY50",
  "alertType": "price_above",
  "targetValue": 23000,
  "message": "NIFTY crossed 23000!"
}

### Get My Alerts (Protected)
GET {{baseURL}}/market/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Active Alerts Only (Protected)
GET {{baseURL}}/market/alerts?active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete Alert (Protected)
DELETE {{baseURL}}/market/alerts/ALERT_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###############################################
# ACHIEVEMENTS
###############################################

### Get All Achievements
GET {{baseURL}}/achievements

### Get Achievements by Category
GET {{baseURL}}/achievements?category=Learning

### Get My Achievements (Protected)
GET {{baseURL}}/achievements/my
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Seed Default Achievements (Admin Only)
POST {{baseURL}}/achievements/seed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###############################################
# DASHBOARD
###############################################

### Get Dashboard Stats (Protected)
GET {{baseURL}}/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Recent Activity (Protected)
GET {{baseURL}}/dashboard/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Learning Progress (Protected)
GET {{baseURL}}/dashboard/learning
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Community Engagement (Protected)
GET {{baseURL}}/dashboard/community
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Weekly Summary (Protected)
GET {{baseURL}}/dashboard/weekly
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###############################################
# NOTES
###############################################

# After successful login, replace {{token}} with the actual JWT token
# Most protected routes require the Authorization header
# Sample users after seeding:
#   - admin@netblade.com / Admin@123 (Admin)
#   - john@example.com / Password@123 (User)
